SpecialTooltips: {
	Viewer: Hold [Shift] to view lore
	Listen: Hold [Shift] to listen closer
	Blooming: Hold [Shift] to read about blooming conditions
}

GameTips: {
	MadnessShroomTip: Giving Madness Mushrooms to a true mushroom enthusiast will grant you nice rewards.
	GeodeTip: Breaking all kinds of stone will reveal hidden Geodes inside, they may even contain ancient relics!
	RealityShroomTip: A blessing from the Keeper is what you wish for? Try to ask your trusty administrator.
	IceDrakeTip: Giving juvenile Ice Drakes the Feast of Midas may result in them staying with you.
	MadnessNightTip: After the defeat of a great evil, madness may awaken at night.
	MushForestTip: In the scarlet forests not far beyond the journey's beginning, you can find pricey mushrooms. But beware of the consequences.
	DimensiumTip: Don't know what to do with all those shiny blue crystals? Don't worry, a dimensional traveller will arrive soon enough!
	VikingTip: Remnants of once proud warriors can be found all across the icy caverns.
	RahlemTip: The antlion infested desert caves contain remnants of a once proud cult.
	PitTip: The east of the underworld attracts many demonic warriors, only glory or death awaits them.
}

WindowTitles: {
	Space: Press space to live
	Religion: Bible III, the coming of shroom
